  "articles": {
    "Guts": {
      "title": "Guts",
      "url": "https://bindingofisaacrebirth.wiki.gg/wiki/Guts",
      "revision_url": "https://bindingofisaacrebirth.wiki.gg/index.php?oldid=266739",
      "revision": 266739,
      "timestamp": "2026-07-27T05:31:51Z",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "attribution": "The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki contributors",
      "sections": [
        {
          "heading": "Introduction",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Guts is a monster that attaches itself to a wall or obstacle, such as a rock, rolling around the contour of the terrain.\nIf the obstacle it is attached to is destroyed, then it will continue rolling in the direction it was previously traveling until it meets another wall or obstacle.\n\nThey make up for their limited movement by being very fast, and in numbers they can tighten movement space (especially in layouts containing narrow passages). Two of them are spawned by Mama Guts upon death."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Variations",
          "level": 2,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "heading": "Scarred Guts",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Scarred Guts are paler versions of the regular Guts. They have a 50% chance of replacing normal Guts in the Scarred Womb. They behave identically to regular Guts but leave behind a trail of damaging Red Creep and move slightly faster than their regular counterparts."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Slog",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Slogs are much darker than Guts and bear a yellow eye in their center that follows Isaac's position. Initially, they behave identically to Guts while moving slightly slower and leaving behind a trail of slowing Black Creep. However, when Isaac cardinally aligns with them, they charge at him until colliding with a wall or obstacle, where they will then resume their previous behavior. Slogs are exclusive to the Dank Depths."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Cyst",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Cysts behave like normal Guts but they will occasionally shoot 1 blood shot towards Isaac if he is close enough.\n\nTwo of them will be spawned if a Dead Meat is killed."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Notes",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "\u2022 Guts and their variants are immune to Strange Attractor's effect."
        },
        {
          "heading": "Gallery",
          "level": 2,
          "text": ""
        },
        {
          "heading": "Trivia",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "\u2022 [Repentance] The Cyst first appeared in the Antibirth mod.\n\n\u2022 Cysts in real life are abnormal growths, usually non-cancerous, filled with fluid or other semi-solid substances. Some even develop in organs or contain pores."
        }
      ],
